# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 1: INTRO & OPENING PATH
# ==============================================================================
~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Isaac: *His head consists of a giant spherical cluster of dozens of un-blinking ocular eyes, glowing halo hovering softly as white wings rustle.*
Isaac: *His chiseled, well-built muscular physique is clad in dark athletic gym shorts, sitting comfortably with an open posture.*
Isaac: *Vocal cords chime with soft, multi-harmonic metallic chords.*
Isaac: Welcome, suitor. It is a true pleasure to sit with you tonight.

- "Your wings and presence are breathtaking."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("angel") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Isaac: *His golden halo brightens warmly, dozens of ocular eyes blinking in timid surprise as his wings rustle.*
		Isaac: Ah... thank you. My body is strictly symmetrical, but my head... well, my head is a chaotic cluster of random eyes. Mother always says true beauty shines from within, but I still get self-conscious...
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Isaac: *Multi-harmonic chime resonates warmly as his white wings rustle softly.*
		Isaac: Thank you! I appreciate a suitor who sees the beauty behind my celestial form.
	=> hub_part_1

- "I noticed your ocular eye cluster scanning."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Isaac: *Dozens of eyes shift softly, pupil pupils adjusting in unison.*
	Isaac: A keen observation! My eyes process ambient light and room layout to ensure everyone feels comfortable.
	=> hub_part_1

- "Do you always sit so stiffly?"
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("angel") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
		Isaac: *Vocal tone shifts to a low metallic hum, halo dimming.*
		Isaac: Mother always taught me that good posture is the foundation of character! Slouching causes unnecessary fatigue.
		=> hub_part_1

- "You look terrifying. I don't trust eye clusters."
	do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -25)
	if GameManager.get_affection("angel") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Isaac: *Dozens of pupils lock onto you simultaneously, halo blazing with harsh light.*
		Isaac: Mind your tongue, suitor. I am here for peaceful conversation, not cruel judgment.
		=> hub_part_1

# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 2: FIRST TOPIC LOOP (PART 1 - 4 TOPICS WITH FOLLOW-UP CHOICES)
# ==============================================================================
~ hub_part_1
if GameManager.get_affection("angel") <= 0:
	=> horror_exit

do GameManager.set_expression("normal")

# Automatically progress to Phase 3 after completing all 4 Part 1 topics
if GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_a") and GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_b") and GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_c") and GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_d"):
	=> mid_date_interruption

Isaac: So, my suitor... what would you like to know about me first?

- "Tell me about your gym workouts!" [if not GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_a")]
	=> p1_topic_a

- "What are your hopes for your future?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_b")]
	=> p1_topic_b

- "How do you handle sitting in dark rooms?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_c")]
	=> p1_topic_c

- "What kind of meals do you enjoy eating?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("angel", "asked_p1_topic_d")]
	=> p1_topic_d

